- Review current state of the system from KMX-provided CAD and documentation. This includes current system functions, operations, and pre-selected hardware. KMX has provided (4) lists of preselected hardware which will be rereviewed and quoted. Some of this work has already been completed in preparation of this proposal. 

- **Advance Current System Design to Fabrication Readiness**

- Johnston Engineering will finalize the existing system design by addressing the remaining mechanical and structural requirements necessary for fabrication. These design tasks have been jointly identified by KMX and Johnston Engineering during SOW review meetings. These design tasks include securing multiple sections of the dual trailer for transportation loads and relocating/ packaging of sections of the system. This task includes refining system details to ensure compliance with operational needs, transportation loading requirements, and fabrication feasibility. 

