# Deliverables

- 3D CAD models and 2D fabrication drawings of all parts and assemblies in completed system

- Bill of Materials (BOM). Specification of OTS equipment and custom hardware: Define all required components for system integration with input from KMX on previously selected and preferred hardware.

- Pressure drop and structural analysis reports

- PLC logic and Human-Machine Interface (HMI) for system control (Siemens)

- Assembled, functional Dual Trailer Vacuum Membrane Distillation (VMD) System

- System shipped to KMX preferred location. 

# Exclusions

- Onsite installation, commissioning, or operator training (unless separately scoped)

- Membrane performance testing beyond mechanical and control verification

